      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "俺たちの町、レギアは今日も平穏そのものさ。\nでも、それは自警団の連中の頑張りのおかげなんだ。\nいつもケチな町長が、どういう訳か金をくれてね。\n連中の労をねぎらう舞を披露してやってくれよ。",
        "official_en": "Thanks to the citizen militia, our village is the\npicture of tranquility! Our mayor—usually a stingy\nman—gave us money to celebrate them. So we'd like\na dancer to come perform for us.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
