      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ありがとう！　素晴らしい舞だった。\nみんな喜んだんだが、町長が一番興奮してたぜ。\nこんな楽しいの、これっきりかって思ってたけど、\nまた次があるって期待できそうだ。感謝だぜ！",
        "official_en": "Thank you! That was wonderful, an even more\njoyous occasion than expected. Everyone was\npleased, the mayor most of all. Perhaps you'll come\ndance for us again soon?",
        "real_en": null
      },
